0.3.0-alpha.1:
  Add native continuous energy sensor (kWh) for Home Assistant Energy Dashboard.
  Add Load Percent sensor.
  Modernize to modern Home Assistant standards (entry.runtime_data, typed ConfigEntry).
  Set _attr_has_entity_name and remove hardcoded entity_ids.
  Add dynamic DeviceInfo with live UPS model and firmware numbers.
  Return typed numeric states (int/float) for statistics and graphing.
  Add connection validation and Options Flow to config flow.
  Add strings.json and update translations.
  Modernize extras/pwrstat API with standard Flask and regex parsing.
  Add /health endpoint and healthcheck to Docker setup.
  Switch Dockerfile to python:3.12-slim.
  Add hacs.json for custom repository HACS compatibility.
  Fix fd command in install script.
  Update documentation.
